tent": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About Future Actions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use four different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>When you talk about things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.</li> <li>When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span>.</li> <li>When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense.</li> <li>When you talk about schedules or timetables in the future, you use the Simple Present tense.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It'll be great.</br> I'll call her later.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm going to a movie tomorrow.</br> You guys are going to have a super time.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She's expecting your call at around 9 tonight.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The movie starts at 8 tomorrow.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "distinct", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very different", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She has a distinct sense of humor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you describe people's personalities and behaviors.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "killer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very attractive", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She has a killer smile.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "extrovert", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who is very active, lively, and friendly ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm not much of an extrovert, you know.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "apprehensive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "being afraid that something bad may happen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Are you feeling a little apprehensive?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "consistently", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to do the same thing all the time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I know someone who consistently goes to the movies on Friday nights.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Prepare a dialogue (10-12 sentences) about what you are doing now and what you are doing next week.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your dialogue to your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss your future plans with your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Switch roles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I can write a dialogue about my present and future plans.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I can share my dialogue with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I can discuss my future plans with my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I can listen to my partner share their plans.", "type": "text"}]}]}